{"2341220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Abaddon", "steam_appid": 2341220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Abaddon</i> is a classic first person psychological horror game, featuring disturbing gameplay and a haunting, character driven narrative. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2341220/extras/b9eca33544110b6e1df8ebbc781fdcc1.poster.avif?t=1778106364\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2341220/extras/b9eca33544110b6e1df8ebbc781fdcc1.webm?t=1778106364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2341220/extras/b9eca33544110b6e1df8ebbc781fdcc1.mp4?t=1778106364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>STORYLINE</i> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What would you do if your little brother disappeared without a trace… and the only path forward led to a place shaped by fear, not physics? Play as <i>Jimmy</i>, a 22 year old dragged into a collapsing reality, where memory, guilt, and grief twist the world around him. To find your brother <i>Georgie</i> you’ll have to confront the horrors of your past, and a world that was never meant to be seen. Will you uncover the truth, or be consumed by it?   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2341220/extras/bd66e6965b1d3651cb9ddc17809cf1f6.poster.avif?t=1778106364\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2341220/extras/bd66e6965b1d3651cb9ddc17809cf1f6.webm?t=1778106364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2341220/extras/bd66e6965b1d3651cb9ddc17809cf1f6.mp4?t=1778106364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Characters:</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone in the game has a story - twisted, broken, and all too human. The deeper you go, the more their secrets intertwine with yours. But beware, every step forward draws the eyes of something large, and hungry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2341220/extras/370182cbcdf97782cef9bc2239e02fab.poster.avif?t=1778106364\" width=640 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2341220/extras/370182cbcdf97782cef9bc2239e02fab.webm?t=1778106364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2341220/extras/370182cbcdf97782cef9bc2239e02fab.mp4?t=1778106364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Gameplay:</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a twisted, surreal world full of puzzles, pain, torture and cosmic dread. Use your flashlight and your wits to survive. And remember, although you are on your own own, you are NEVER alone in the darkness.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u> </u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Note from team:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are an indie game studio called Nice to Meet Studios LTD. Having played horror games for over a decade, our love for the genre led us to create Abaddon. The game is a pure love letter to the classic horror titles that inspired us, such as Amnesia: The Dark Descent, P.T., Outlast, Visage, MADiSON, Detention, Resident Evil, and many others. Abaddon is designed to deliver a terrifying, classic horror experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our goal is to make players suffer and terrify them in a deeply immersive horror experience that stays with you.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Abaddon</i> is a classic first person psychological horror game, featuring disturbing gameplay and a haunting, character driven narrative. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2341220/extras/b9eca33544110b6e1df8ebbc781fdcc1.poster.avif?t=1778106364\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2341220/extras/b9eca33544110b6e1df8ebbc781fdcc1.webm?t=1778106364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2341220/extras/b9eca33544110b6e1df8ebbc781fdcc1.mp4?t=1778106364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>STORYLINE</i> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What would you do if your little brother disappeared without a trace… and the only path forward led to a place shaped by fear, not physics? Play as <i>Jimmy</i>, a 22 year old dragged into a collapsing reality, where memory, guilt, and grief twist the world around him. To find your brother <i>Georgie</i> you’ll have to confront the horrors of your past, and a world that was never meant to be seen. Will you uncover the truth, or be consumed by it?   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2341220/extras/bd66e6965b1d3651cb9ddc17809cf1f6.poster.avif?t=1778106364\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2341220/extras/bd66e6965b1d3651cb9ddc17809cf1f6.webm?t=1778106364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2341220/extras/bd66e6965b1d3651cb9ddc17809cf1f6.mp4?t=1778106364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Characters:</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone in the game has a story - twisted, broken, and all too human. The deeper you go, the more their secrets intertwine with yours. But beware, every step forward draws the eyes of something large, and hungry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2341220/extras/370182cbcdf97782cef9bc2239e02fab.poster.avif?t=1778106364\" width=640 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2341220/extras/370182cbcdf97782cef9bc2239e02fab.webm?t=1778106364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2341220/extras/370182cbcdf97782cef9bc2239e02fab.mp4?t=1778106364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Gameplay:</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a twisted, surreal world full of puzzles, pain, torture and cosmic dread. Use your flashlight and your wits to survive. And remember, although you are on your own own, you are NEVER alone in the darkness.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u> </u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Note from team:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are an indie game studio called Nice to Meet Studios LTD. Having played horror games for over a decade, our love for the genre led us to create Abaddon. The game is a pure love letter to the classic horror titles that inspired us, such as Amnesia: The Dark Descent, P.T., Outlast, Visage, MADiSON, Detention, Resident Evil, and many others. Abaddon is designed to deliver a terrifying, classic horror experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our goal is to make players suffer and terrify them in a deeply immersive horror experience that stays with you.</p>", "short_description": "Abaddon is a story driven first person psychological horror game. Descend into a suffocating, nightmarish world as Jimmy searches for his missing brother, Georgie. With only a flickering flashlight, solve chilling puzzles, face your past, and struggle to survive.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2341220/a249e6f4b72141a79caa8e6b9afa056866280b76/header.jpg?t=1778106364", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2341220/2cb4feeb0f84806c466c86832fe492812c55e447/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1778106364", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2341220/2cb4feeb0f84806c466c86832fe492812c55e447/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1778106364", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 1660<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Specs are still being tested and optimization is being applied</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "All rights reserved to Nice to meet studios LTD", "developers": ["Nice to meet studios LTD"], "publishers": ["Nice to meet studios LTD"], "demos": [{"appid": 3019620, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Ac